<div id="layer-savegames" class="app-layer hidden flex flex-col p-4 h-screen w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#060913]">
 <header class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-3 shrink-0"><div><p class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.3em] text-cyan-400">DATOS DE CONSOLA</p><h2 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight">Biblioteca de partidas</h2></div><button onclick="volverAlLauncher()" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border border-white/10 text-gray-300"><i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i></button></header>
 <div class="flex items-center gap-2 py-3 shrink-0"><button onclick="savesRecargar()" class="h-9 rounded-xl border border-cyan-400/20 bg-cyan-400/5 px-3 text-[10px] font-bold text-cyan-200"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate mr-1"></i> Actualizar</button><span id="save-summary" class="text-[9px] text-gray-500"></span></div>
 <div id="save-warning" class="mb-3 rounded-2xl border border-amber-400/20 bg-amber-400/5 px-3 py-2 text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-amber-100 shrink-0"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved mr-1"></i> El ZIP del Manager sirve para respaldar y restaurar desde este módulo; conserva los archivos FTP `savedata/` y `savedata_meta/`, no es una exportación directa para Apollo. Para crear una copia Apollo, usa <b>Apollo → HDD Saves → Copy save game</b>; Apollo genera la estructura `PS4/APOLLO/...` con `sce_sys`. Verifica la importación antes de borrar la partida original.</div>
 <main class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar pb-24"><div id="save-list" class="space-y-2"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/5 p-4 text-xs text-gray-400">Conecta la PS4 y pulsa Actualizar para leer partidas.</div></div><section class="mt-5 border-t border-white/5 pt-3"><h3 class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-200">Respaldos locales</h3><p class="mt-1 text-[9px] text-gray-500">Los ZIP se conservan aunque elimines la partida de la consola.</p><div id="save-archives-list" class="mt-2 space-y-2"></div></section></main>
</div>
<div id="modal-save-confirm" class="fixed inset-0 z-[12000] hidden items-center justify-center bg-black/85 p-5" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"><div class="w-full max-w-md rounded-3xl border border-rose-400/30 bg-[#0a0f1a] p-5"><h3 id="save-confirm-title" class="text-lg font-black text-white">Confirmar</h3><p id="save-confirm-text" class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-300"></p><div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2"><button onclick="savesCancelarConfirmacion()" class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 py-3 text-xs text-gray-300">Cancelar</button><button id="save-confirm-action" class="rounded-xl bg-rose-500/90 py-3 text-xs font-black uppercase text-white">Continuar</button></div></div></div>
